    {
      "id": "06d8187b-7afd-4516-a9ae-e59177cb0177",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-sec1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        32,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1062,
        "height": 354,
        "content": "**1. Fetch & Dedupe Reviews**\n\nRuns on a schedule, collects new reviews using demo data that can be replaced with the Google Business Profile Reviews API, checks Supabase for reviews that have already been processed, and filters out duplicates before processing each new review one at a time."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5d5acc79-eff2-4169-a401-eebb6ce0721e",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-sec2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1136,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 694,
        "height": 578,
        "content": "**2. AI Analyze & Draft Reply**\n\nAI analyzes each review for sentiment, topics, intent and urgency, then drafts a warm, on-brand public reply based only on what the review actually says."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "22672f0b-7acf-4068-8369-888effcd953e",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-sec3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1856,
        64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 406,
        "height": 770,
        "content": "**3. Route by Sentiment**\n\nRoutes the review down a positive, neutral, or negative path and tags it with the matching response strategy."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7c91f262-cd24-416b-88b9-22a29535d7fe",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-sec4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2288,
        256
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 774,
        "height": 578,
        "content": "**4. Escalation Check & Save**\n\nAI checks whether a review needs human attention, such as low ratings, complaints, or legal and safety concerns. It then applies fixed rules to the AI decision, creates the final review record, and saves it to Supabase."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "69b636d5-c41e-47b8-b773-bdf4b6f3f91a",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-sec5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3088,
        192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 662,
        "height": 418,
        "content": "**5. Human Approval**\n\nReviews flagged for escalation pause here and post to Slack for a human to approve or reject the drafted reply before anything goes public (24h timeout)."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6d396c41-c77e-4379-ac10-e87d9b58ac83",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-sec6",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3776,
        192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 854,
        "height": 370,
        "content": "**6. Resolve & Publish**\n\nDetermines the final decision based on approval status, rejection, or timeout, publishes the reply using a mock endpoint that can be replaced with the Google Business Profile Reply API, and updates the review status in Supabase."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "72f97e0c-46a7-48ed-b490-e88016a7ad29",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-sec7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4672,
        192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1008,
        "height": 626,
        "content": "**7. Notify & Save Insights**\n\nIdentifies important reviews, such as 5-star reviews, low ratings, high-priority feedback, or failed replies, and notifies the business owner on Slack. It also extracts useful business insights from every review and saves them to Supabase."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5b3a78eb-14c3-429e-bffc-c034617fc9d7",
      "name": "Sticky - sticky-main",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -560,
        192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": "#E4DA62",
        "width": 532,
        "height": 808,
        "content": "## **AI Review & Reputation Management**\n\n**Who it's for:** Restaurants, hotels, clinics, agencies, and other local service businesses that want to respond to customer reviews quickly and consistently without someone manually reading, drafting, and posting replies all day.\n\n**What it does:** Automatically pulls in new reviews, uses AI to analyze sentiment and draft a reply, routes anything sensitive to a human for approval on Slack, publishes approved replies, and logs reusable feedback insights for the business.\n\n**How it works**\n1. Runs every 3 hours and fetches new reviews\n2. Skips reviews already processed in Supabase\n3. AI analyzes sentiment, topics, intent and urgency\n4. AI drafts a public reply matching the review's tone\n5. Review is routed by sentiment (positive/neutral/negative)\n6. AI checks whether the review needs human approval\n7. Flagged reviews go to Slack for a human to approve or reject\n8. Approved replies are published; everything is logged in Supabase\n9. Important reviews trigger a Slack notification to the owner\n10. AI extracts a feedback insight from every review for later analysis\n\n**How to set up**\n\u2610 Connect Supabase and create `reviews` and `feedback_insights` tables\n\u2610 Connect Slack and set your own channel for approvals and owner notifications\n\u2610 Connect Anthropic (used for analysis, reply drafting, escalation checks, and insights)\n\u2610 Replace the demo \"Get New Reviews\" code node with a real reviews API call\n\u2610 Replace the mock \"Publish Response\" endpoint with your real publish-reply API\n\n**CUSTOMIZATION**\n- Adjust the schedule interval and escalation rules (ratings, keywords, urgency)\n- Edit the AI prompts for tone, allowed topics, or response style\n- Change the approval wait time or what counts as an \"important\" review"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
